<title>UK: Brit Biotech plans ovarian cancer trial.</title>
<headline>Brit Biotech plans ovarian cancer trial.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Biotech Plc said on Wednesday it had started late-stage trials of anti-cancer drug Marimastat in non-small lung cell cancer, and planned to start trials in ovarian cancer this month.</p>
<p>In a statement British Biotech said Phase III trials of its most promising drug were already underway in small cell lung cancer, brain cancer, stomach cancer and pancreatic cancer.</p>
